  "body": "Stacked on #1817 (merge #1817 first)\n\n## What changed\n- Added `crates/ui/src/egui_app/rest_pocket_page.rs` with `seed_rest` and `rest_group`.\n- Added the `Rest machining` group on the `Passes` (`SEC_PASSES`) tab of `2D Pocket` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mill2d_page.rs`.\n- Added an on/off switch in the group header, defaulted to off, and four fields: `Prev. tool Ø`, `Prev. corner rad.`, `Prev. stock left`, and `Rest allowance`.\n- Added prose hover tooltips and live document unit conversion for all four fields.\n- Added `pub tool_diameter: Option<f64>` to `Cx<'a>` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/params_page.rs`.\n- Toggling the switch on calls `seed_rest` with `(d * 2.0).max(1.0)` (or `12.0` mm fallback) and `0.0` for the other three fields.\n- Displayed inline `consequence` warnings for incompatible `PocketStrategy` (`rest_strategy`) or `approach.predrilled` (`REST_PREDRILLED`).\n- Committed changes and surfaced `#1489` named refusals through `EditOperationParams` on Apply.\n- Added `crates/ui/src/egui_app/rest_pocket_tests.rs`, registered modules in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mod.rs`, updated `every_field_lives_on_exactly_one_section` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`, and added `docs/decisions/1815-rest-pocket-page.md`.\n\n### Screenshots\n| State | Screenshot |\n|---|---|\n| Before (`2D Pocket` -> `Passes` on `#1817`) | ![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/87758500393d8ac96df7f8ceeaf3eb00d7f34e5f/1815/before.png) |\n| After (`Rest machining` off by default) | ![after-off](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/87758500393d8ac96df7f8ceeaf3eb00d7f34e5f/1815/after-off.png) |\n| After (`Rest machining` switched on) | ![after-on](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/87758500393d8ac96df7f8ceeaf3eb00d7f34e5f/1815/after-on.png) |\n\n## Cause\n- PR `#1817` (`#1489`) matched `OpParams::Pocket { rest: _, .. }` without drawing a UI group. Users could not view or edit rest machining in the `2D Pocket` page.\n\n## Tests\n- **Pinning tests (red before fix, green after):**\n  - `rest_group_defaults_off_on_pocket_passes_only_and_hides_fields_when_off`\n  - `rest_group_toggles_edits_draft_commits_via_apply_and_undoes`\n  - `rest_group_refuses_non_larger_previous_tool_by_name_on_apply`\n  - `rest_group_warns_and_refuses_incompatible_strategy_and_predrilled_on_apply`\n  - `rest_group_respects_document_unit_lens`\n- **Structural UI tests (green):**\n  - `every_field_lives_on_exactly_one_section`\n  - `every_registry_kind_gets_its_tab_bar`\n  - `egui_app::tests::structural::*` (10 structural tests passed in gate `ui suites`)\n- **Mutations (4 red before restore, green after restore):**\n  1. Reverted `mill2d_page.rs` stub (`rest: _,`) -> rest group pins failed.\n  2. Removed `*rest = None` switch-off clear -> toggle and undo pin failed.\n  3. Removed `rest_strategy(*strategy)` inline consequence -> warning pin failed.\n  4. Disabled `approach.predrilled` inline consequence -> warning pin failed.\n- **Quick gate & clippy:**\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`3 step(s), 0 failed`, `wall 31.4 min`). Motion suites passed (`655s`). App suites passed (`1191s`). UI suites passed (`32s`, `818` lib tests passed with `6` ignored release pixel snapshots, plus all `8` listed UI integration binaries passed).\n  - `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test egui_app`: `3 passed; 0 failed`.\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (`exit 0`).\n\n## Goldens moved\n- None in commit `9567d3a8d` (`#1815`). (Stack parent `#1817` adds `crates/app/tests/golden/pocket_rest_corners.cl`.)\n\n## Not exercised\n- Windows-only release pixel-snapshot lanes (ignored in Linux quick gate).\n- Interactive desktop click and hover session outside `egui_kittest` offscreen renders.\n- `2D Adaptive` rest engagement (`#2031`) and deriving rest values from prior operations (`#2033`).\n\n## Overlaps\n- **PR `#1817`** (stack parent, open): `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mill2d_page.rs::fields` (`rest: _,` replaced here; merge `#1817` first).\n- **PR `#2037`** (open, stacked on `#1817`): `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mill2d_page.rs::fields` keeps `rest: _,`. PR `#2037` changes `rest_strategy(PocketStrategy::Zigzag)` to `Ok` and moves refusal to `Adaptive`. `rest_group` already delegates to `rest_strategy(*strategy)`. If `#2037` merges first, update `rest_group_warns_and_refuses_incompatible_strategy_and_predrilled_on_apply` to test `PocketStrategy::Adaptive`.\n- **PR `#1938`** (open): `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mod.rs` adds `mod start_exit_rows;` at a different line, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs::every_field_lives_on_exactly_one_section` updates Contour `Lead in / Lead out`, not Pocket `Passes`.\n- Other open PRs touch `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mod.rs` (`#1209`, `#1330`, `#1798`, `#2077`) or `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs` (`#1209`, `#1330`, `#1685`, `#1753`, `#1931`, `#1996`, `#2023`, `#2027`, `#2036`, `#2068`, `#2077`, `#2078`, `#2081`, `#2086`, `#2090`, `#2091`, `#2092`) on unrelated lines.\n\n## Decision record\n- `docs/decisions/1815-rest-pocket-page.md`\n\nEffort: medium\nChangelog: Add Rest machining group to the 2D Pocket Passes tab.\nFixes #1815\n\nProcess change: yes\n",
